Public-domain character base data (CC0 1.0 Universal)
-----------------------------------------------------
assets/characters/realistic/source/ and assets/characters/humanoid/source/
derive base body geometry from Blender Studio Human Base Meshes v1.4.1 and
body shape targets from MakeHuman (hm08), both released under CC0 1.0
Universal (see assets/characters/transfer/shapes/LICENCE-RECORD.md).

MakeHuman
---------
assets/characters/human/ (the human base body, its eyes, teeth, tongue,
brows and lashes, its skin texture, and the garments in its wardrobe/
folder) is made from MakeHuman's base mesh, targets and system assets
(http://www.makehumancommunity.org), released under CC0 1.0 Universal by
their copyright holders: Data Collection AB, Joel Palmius and Jonas
Hauquier. CC0 asks for no attribution; the MakeHuman project and its
community are credited here with thanks.

Garments converted from the MakeHuman community's asset packs
(https://static.makehumancommunity.org/assets/assetpacks.html) keep their
authors' licences, CC0 1.0 or Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), recorded per item in its
manifest's "source" and in the CREDITS.md beside the items
(assets/characters/human/wardrobe/CREDITS.md for those shipped here).
They were re-posed, re-skinned to the Axcenity Humanoid skeleton and
given the body's shapes; their textures are unchanged.

These assets were made with MPFB (https://static.makehumancommunity.org/mpfb.html),
the MakeHuman Plugin For Blender by Joel Palmius and the MakeHuman
community, licensed GPL-3.0-or-later. MPFB is used as a tool: no MPFB or
MakeHuman source code is included in this repository or in anything built
from it (assets/characters/human/README.md, "Sources and credit").
